379:
(a) The owner of any vacant building shall register the building with the city's building and inspections department within thirty (30) days after the building becomes vacant.
(b) Registration shall be submitted upon forms approved by the building official and shall contain:
(1) The name, mailing address, telephone number, and electronic mail address of the owner;
(2) The address of the vacant building;
(3) The name and contact information of any property manager;
(4) The name and contact information of the responsible local agent, if applicable; and
(5) Such additional information as may reasonably be required by the building official.
(c) Registration shall remain valid for one (1) year and shall be renewed annually for so long as the building remains vacant.
(d) The city council may establish and amend registration fees by resolution.
(Ord. No. 2026-16, § 1(Exh. A), 6-15-26)

380:
