(Ord. No. 2026-16, § 1(Exh. A), 6-15-26)

382:
(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to:
(1) Fail to register a vacant building as required by this article;
(2) Fail to maintain a vacant building in compliance with this article;
(3) Fail to provide or maintain a responsible local agent when required; or
(4) Fail to comply with a lawful order issued pursuant to this article.
(b) Except as otherwise provided herein, violations of this article shall be punishable in accordance with section 1-8 of this Code.
