(2) When such plumbing or sewerage system within such existing building, because of its capacity, design, or installation would not function properly if the toilets, faucets or showerheads required by this ordinance [sections 5-156 through 5-159.4] were installed. This exemption includes, but is not limited to, showers and faucets installed for safety purposes, such as an emergency eyewash station;
